{"ID":"20240118151008-zs6ytt9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151008-zs6ytt9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151008-zs6ytt9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122153706-izvweu5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240204105233-dlc0pt6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122153733-dk7soa0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:40\u0026#125;","title":"295羊蹄296萹蓄","type":"doc","updated":"20240204105239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240122153706-izvweu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153706-izvweu5","updated":"20240122153707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"羊蹄"}]},{"ID":"20240118151008-qq94ahb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151008-qq94ahb","updated":"20240122153656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦、寒、无毒。治头秃，疥瘙，除热，女子阴蚀。生川泽。一名东方宿，一名连虫陆，一名鬼目。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153710-4ckzab5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153710-4ckzab5","updated":"20240204105050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，多生山野下湿之地，叶长似菜，故亦曰羊蹄菜，根黄白色，粗大似葫芦巴。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153712-a82h2et","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153712-a82h2et"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦、性寒、无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153714-npfzr8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153714-npfzr8t"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】羊蹄主杀虫，治疥癣，肿疡，清血热，疗肠风，便秘。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153715-beectjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153715-beectjv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】浸淫疽痔，杀虫。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153716-rg4vzuh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153716-rg4vzuh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】治癣，杀一切虫，醋磨贴肿毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153717-i01k3sq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153717-i01k3sq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通二至三钱，外用无定量。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153719-txjy32z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153719-txjy32z"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】多食下气，令人作泻，故有人取以代大黄者。伏龙山下的人添：头风白屑∶羊蹄草根曝干杵末，同羊胆汁涂之，永除。（《圣惠方》）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153658-1kyd0ng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153658-1kyd0ng"}},{"ID":"20240122153728-hv36g7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153728-hv36g7t","updated":"20240204105044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二九五，这个羊蹄，很少用，诸位就看一下就可以了。羊蹄主杀虫，疥癣，也是癣类的，这种使用得不多，吃多了会让人家拉肚子。"}]},{"ID":"20240122153729-177fhqr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153729-177fhqr"}},{"ID":"20240122153729-cnizx0b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153729-cnizx0b","updated":"20240122153732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"萹蓄"}]},{"ID":"20240122153733-dk7soa0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153733-dk7soa0","updated":"20240122153738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，平，无毒．治浸淫，疥瘙，疽，痔，杀三虫。生山谷。一名萹竹。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153740-zteei89","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153740-zteei89"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，多繁殖路旁，叶细绿。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153742-t0z4yrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153742-t0z4yrl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153744-pl87tc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153744-pl87tc1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】萹蓄草为杀虫疥，利小便要药，治湿疮浸淫，热淋涩痛，热疾黄疸。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153746-g4blri0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153746-g4blri0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗女子阴蚀。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153747-evva2em","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153747-evva2em"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】煮汁饮小儿，疗蚘虫有验。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153749-lrshqz9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153749-lrshqz9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153750-bnsul56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153750-bnsul56"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】无湿热者勿用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153751-b3msagu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153751-b3msagu"}},{"ID":"20240122153751-ev9it9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153751-ev9it9b"}},{"ID":"20240122153751-y4e6k1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153751-y4e6k1a","updated":"20240204105152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二九六，这是萹蓄，诸位看萹蓄长成这样子。这个药呢，也是杀虫，还有皮肤病的时候使用，内服也可以，外敷，洗用也可以。主治洗身上的疥虫，这个皮肤很痒，这个也可以内服。这个很轻，你们看，它质地非常的轻，所以排、皮肤病或者去虫的时候，1钱的量就已经很多了，2钱，那就是肚子里面你确定他虫很多的时候。这种打虫药一吃下去，大多数都是从大便排出来，吃完以后会拉肚子。一到厕所，哇！一票虫排出来，所以要赶快冲掉，会吓死人的。"}]},{"ID":"20240122153757-ha642pu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153757-ha642pu","updated":"20240204105239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那小朋友呢，肚子里面有虫，我们检查的方式很多，第一个你看如果有虫的话，肚子会很大，挺起来，硬梆梆的；第二个你把他下唇拉起来一看，哦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"牙齿下方的牙龈的地方，你会看到很多白色的虫卵一样的，一粒粒的，白色的，它就长在那边，眼白里边有蓝点，都是肚子里边有虫。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240204105233-dlc0pt6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204105233-dlc0pt6","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"}}]}